  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Text to Change (TCC) wants to set up ang manage a call centre for    mobile market research and marketing in East-Africa.... One of the    goals of MRA [Mobile Research Africa] is collecting and dessimination important information on education, economic development and health   education for poverty reduction.&quot;</narrative>
